      "created_at": "2021-08-11T21:53:59.898Z",
      "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>Maddening Whispers (A): Hinder multiple targets using [power]. Recover Health equal to your Min die. If you roll doubles, also Attack one of those targets using your Max die.<br>\nGroup Fighter (I): When you take an action that lets you make an Attack, also make an Attack using your Mid die.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>When using Maddening Whispers, does Group Fighter always trigger, or does it only trigger when rolling doubles?<br>\nMaddening Whispers technically let’s you make an attack, but it’s gated behind rolling doubles. Does this make a difference?</p>",
